  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="price_clause">
        <p>Ego Margarita filia quondam Bernardi, recognoscens me habuisse et recepisse a Thoma fratre meo triginta florenos auri pro mea legitima portione in hereditate dicti patris nostri, refuto et renuntio omni iuri et actioni quae mihi competere possent in dicta hereditate, cedens et transferens in dictum Thomam omnia iura mea ...</p>
      </div>
      <div type="penalty_clause">
        <p>Si vero ego vel mei heredes contra hanc refutationem venire praesumpserimus, poenam quinquaginta florenorum auri solvere teneamur, et refutatio haec perpetuo firma et stabilis permaneat ...</p>
      </div>
      <listWitness>
        <witness><name>Franciscus de Bichis</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Iohannes de Saracinis</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Andreas de Rinaldinis</name></witness>
      </listWitness>
    </body>
